node_modules/
dist/
.astro/

# Generated at build time, never authored. Each has a generator and a documented command;
# a checked-in copy is a second source of truth, and it drifts.
#
# `captures/` is the pristine gallery input (`./gradlew :limn-demo:captureGallery`);
# `public/gallery/` is the derivative `pnpm build:gallery` cuts from it. Both are
# generated, so both are ignored, but they are not interchangeable: the captures are the
# only copy the derivation may read.
captures/
src/styles/tokens.generated.css
src/content/docs/
src/generated/
public/gallery/
public/api/
public/icon-*.png
public/site.webmanifest
build-timings.log
